{{Quote|Grants magma-based attacks that deal high damage and burn enemies.|Shop}}
'''Magma''' is a {{Rare}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|960,000}} or {{Robux|1,300}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Magma allows the user to create, become and manipulate magma, shooting out magma projectiles, and allowing hot residual magma to burn enemies on surfaces.

==Awakening==
Magma costs {{Fragment|14,500}} to fully [[Raids|awaken]].

"The Red Dog" [[Titles|title]] #041 will be granted upon awakening the first move of this fruit.

